# Cron alternative to the systemd timer, for hosts without systemd (or where the team
# standardizes on cron). Same script, same env file.
#
# Runs every 10 minutes rather than a fixed "wait N minutes after the schedule"
# assumption -- download_export.sh is idempotent (tracks the last object it
# downloaded, exits cleanly if nothing new exists yet), so frequent runs are safe and
# never double-process an export.
#
# Install as the pgexport user's crontab: crontab -u pgexport -e
*/10 * * * * /opt/pgexport/download_export.sh >> /var/log/pgexport-download.log 2>&1
